{
  "root_cause": "certificate_expiry",
  "summary": "The incident was caused by the expiration of a TLS certificate for the downstream partner payments service, which led to callback delivery failures and a rapidly growing retry queue. This caused a backlog in processing retries and a sharp drop in delivered callbacks, triggering alerts and increased error rates.",
  "onset_ts": "2026-03-17T09:31:00.000Z",
  "timeline": [
    {
      "statement": "A deployment was made at 09:08 with retry backoff tuning, but no immediate issues were observed.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "changes.jsonl",
          "line": 1,
          "quote": "\"ts\":\"2026-03-17T09:08:00.000Z\",\"kind\":\"deploy\",\"summary\":\"worker: retry backoff tuning\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "statement": "At 09:31, the retry queue depth for callbacks surged from 3 to 16, indicating the start of backlog buildup.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "metrics/callbacks.csv",
          "line": 33,
          "quote": "2026-03-17T09:31:00.000Z,41,16"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "statement": "From 09:30 onwards, logs show repeated callback delivery failures with scheduling retries, coinciding with TLS certificate verification errors due to certificate expiry at 09:30.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "logs/app.jsonl",
          "line": 719,
          "quote": "\"ts\":\"2026-03-17T09:30:02.000Z\",\"msg\":\"callback delivery failed, scheduling retry\""
        },
        {
          "source": "logs/app.jsonl",
          "line": 922,
          "quote": "\"ts\":\"2026-03-17T09:35:10.000Z\",\"msg\":\"tls: failed to verify certificate: certificate has expired\",\"notAfter\":\"2026-03-17T09:30:00Z\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "statement": "The retry queue depth escalated dramatically, peaking at 495 at 09:56, while delivered callbacks per minute dropped to 1 by 09:59.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "metrics/callbacks.csv",
          "line": 58,
          "quote": "2026-03-17T09:56:00.000Z,6,495"
        },
        {
          "source": "metrics/callbacks.csv",
          "line": 61,
          "quote": "2026-03-17T09:59:00.000Z,1,245"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "statement": "HTTP error rate increased from baseline ~0.0024 to a peak of 0.0081, indicating increased failures related to callback delivery.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "metrics/http.csv",
          "line": 35,
          "quote": "2026-03-17T09:33:00.000Z,38.79,195.81,0.0081,365"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "statement": "Alerts for CallbackDeliveryStalled and RetryQueueDepth fired starting at 09:34 and 09:44 respectively, confirming operational impact.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "alerts.jsonl",
          "line": 1,
          "quote": "\"ts\":\"2026-03-17T09:34:00.000Z\",\"name\":\"CallbackDeliveryStalled\",\"state\":\"firing\""
        },
        {
          "source": "alerts.jsonl",
          "line": 2,
          "quote": "\"ts\":\"2026-03-17T09:44:00.000Z\",\"name\":\"RetryQueueDepth\",\"state\":\"firing\""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "evidence": [
    {
      "statement": "TLS certificate verification errors with 'certificate has expired' messages for the payments.partner.example peer started at 09:30, matching the onset of callback delivery failures and retry queue buildup.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "logs/app.jsonl",
          "line": 922,
          "quote": "\"tls: failed to verify certificate: certificate has expired\",\"notAfter\":\"2026-03-17T09:30:00Z\""
        },
        {
          "source": "logs/app.jsonl",
          "line": 1214,
          "quote": "\"tls: failed to verify certificate: certificate has expired\",\"notAfter\":\"2026-03-17T09:30:00Z\""
        },
        {
          "source": "logs/app.jsonl",
          "line": 1411,
          "quote": "\"tls: failed to verify certificate: certificate has expired\",\"notAfter\":\"2026-03-17T09:30:00Z\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "statement": "The retry queue depth increased by over 16000% from 3 to 495, and delivered callbacks dropped by 97.8%, indicating a severe processing backlog caused by failed callback deliveries.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "metrics/callbacks.csv",
          "line": 58,
          "quote": "2026-03-17T09:56:00.000Z,6,495"
        },
        {
          "source": "metrics/callbacks.csv",
          "line": 61,
          "quote": "2026-03-17T09:59:00.000Z,1,245"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ruled_out": [
    {
      "statement": "Bad deploy regression is unlikely because the deployment at 09:08 did not immediately cause issues; the onset was at 09:31 and logs show certificate expiry errors unrelated to the deploy.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "changes.jsonl",
          "line": 1,
          "quote": "\"ts\":\"2026-03-17T09:08:00.000Z\",\"kind\":\"deploy\",\"summary\":\"worker: retry backoff tuning\""
        },
        {
          "source": "logs/app.jsonl",
          "line": 922,
          "quote": "\"tls: failed to verify certificate: certificate has expired\",\"notAfter\":\"2026-03-17T09:30:00Z\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "statement": "Resource exhaustion, memory leak, disk exhaustion, or batch job contention are unlikely as HTTP latency and request rates remained stable and no other system-wide resource alerts were triggered.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "metrics/http.csv",
          "line": 2,
          "quote": "2026-03-17T09:00:00.000Z,39.92,188.17,0.0024,343"
        },
        {
          "source": "metrics/http.csv",
          "line": 61,
          "quote": "2026-03-17T09:59:00.000Z,45.39,202.55,0.0074,325"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "statement": "No evidence of DNS failure, upstream rate limiting, schema migration regression, or config change was found in logs or alerts.",
      "citations": []
    }
  ],
  "action_items": [
    "Renew and deploy updated TLS certificates for all downstream partners before expiry.",
    "Implement monitoring and alerting for certificate expiry with sufficient lead time.",
    "Review retry backoff and error handling to prevent retry queue buildup in case of downstream failures.",
    "Conduct a post-mortem review with the partner to coordinate certificate management."
  ]
}

